# Normalise line endings on commit. Without this a file saved on Windows keeps
# its CRLF, and the next editor to touch it flips the whole file to LF — git
# then reports every line as changed. src/Api/appsettings.json did exactly that:
# adding three lines of CORS configuration showed up as 19 insertions and 16
# deletions, which makes a config change unreviewable.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
